  "accepted_answers": ["International Biathlon Union"],
  "explanation": "Document d1 directly states that the Swedish Biathlon Federation is an 'integral member of the International Biathlon Union (IBU), the global authority governing the sport' (D1S5). This is a clear and direct assertion of membership. Document d2 mentions the Swedish Biathlon Federation being a 'member of Kill Devil Hill,' but this is explicitly described as fictional (D2S4), and Kill Devil Hill is a musical group, not an organization or club relevant to biathlon governance. Therefore, only the International Biathlon Union is a valid and supported answer."
}
